---
const winCmd = `scripts\\quick-start.bat`;
const unixCmd = `chmod +x scripts/quick-start.sh && ./scripts/quick-start.sh`;
---

<section class="section" id="quick-start">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title">5 分钟 Quick Start</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">
      Clone 主仓后用 Compose 一键拉起。打开
      <a href="http://localhost">http://localhost</a>，账号
      <code class="inline">admin</code> / <code class="inline">admin123</code>。生产环境务必更换默认口令与
      <code class="inline">token.secret</code>。
    </p>

    <div class="panels">
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <span class="dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
          <span class="label">Windows</span>
          <button type="button" class="copy" data-copy={winCmd}>复制</button>
        </div>
        <pre><code><span class="prompt">PS&gt;</span> {winCmd}</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <span class="dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
          <span class="label">Linux / macOS</span>
          <button type="button" class="copy" data-copy={unixCmd}>复制</button>
        </div>
        <pre><code><span class="prompt">$</span> {unixCmd}</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="more">
      靶场联调见
      <a href="https://github.com/qualitest-hq/qualitest-demo">qualitest-demo</a>
      ；部署细节见
      <a href="https://github.com/qualitest-hq/qualitest/blob/main/docs/deploy.md">docs/deploy.md</a>。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .inline {
    font-family: ui-monospace, "Cascadia Code", "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 0.9em;
    padding: 0.1em 0.35em;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--accent-deep);
  }

  .panels {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.1rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 800px) {
    .panels {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .panel {
    border: 1px solid rgba(12, 18, 34, 0.2);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: linear-gradient(165deg, #152033 0%, #0c1222 100%);
    color: #e2e8f0;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  }

  .panel-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
  }

  .dots {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 0.28rem;
  }

  .dots i {
    width: 0.5rem;
    height: 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #475569;
  }

  .dots i:nth-child(1) {
    background: #f87171;
  }
  .dots i:nth-child(2) {
    background: #fbbf24;
  }
  .dots i:nth-child(3) {
    background: #34d399;
  }

  .label {
    flex: 1;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .copy {
    appearance: none;
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.28);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    color: #cbd5e1;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.22rem 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .copy:hover,
  .copy.done {
    border-color: rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.55);
    color: #5eead4;
    background: rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.1);
  }

  pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.05rem 1rem 1.2rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  pre code {
    color: #f1f5f9;
    font-family: ui-monospace, "Cascadia Code", "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  .prompt {
    color: #2dd4bf;
    margin-right: 0.45rem;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .more {
    margin: 1.35rem 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll(".copy").forEach((btn) => {
    btn.addEventListener("click", async () => {
      const text = btn.getAttribute("data-copy") ?? "";
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
        const prev = btn.textContent;
        btn.textContent = "已复制";
        btn.classList.add("done");
        setTimeout(() => {
          btn.textContent = prev;
          btn.classList.remove("done");
        }, 1600);
      } catch {
        btn.textContent = "失败";
      }
    });
  });
</script>
